#!/usr/bin/env python3
# =============================================================================
# questions — the Open Questions register (#547, adopted into the template 2026-09-26)
#
# The sanctioned "blocked on you" channel (fleet-directives.md §Open Questions
# register). A lane that needs an owner decision registers an ORDERED set of
# questions in the same turn it parks; a renderer emits a card in the CALLING
# session's own topic plus a short-lived public page; answers return to the
# calling session.
#
# Store: <profile home>/questions/open.json, answered sets -> archive.jsonl
# Single writer: flock + atomic replace (tmp -> rename). Two concurrent `ask`
# calls must lose NEITHER set — that is a selftest criterion, not a comment.
#
# Verbs: ask · answer · amend · list · publish · lint · gc · notify
#
# rc vocabulary (tools/docs/RC-CONTRACT.md): 0 ok / 1 finding-or-not-found /
# 2 usage / 3 state-refused (already answered, expired) / 4 store-or-IO fault.
# =============================================================================

